      "title": "Australian Army soldier killed and five others injured in training exercise in the Northern Territory",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/06/australian-defence-force-soldier-killed-five-injuried-mount-bundey-training-northern-territory",
      "description": "<p>Defence confirmed the fatality occurred on Monday at the Mount Bundey training area, with next of kin informed</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>An Australian soldier has died and five others were injured in a training accident at a facility outside Darwin yesterday, according to the defence department.</p><p>The department on Tuesday morning released <a href=\"https://www.defence.gov.au/news-events/releases/2026-10-06/death-australian-soldier\">a statement</a> confirming the incident, which occurred at the Mount Bundey training area, around 100km south-east of Darwin in the Northern Territory.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/06/australian-defence-force-soldier-killed-five-injuried-mount-bundey-training-northern-territory\">Continue reading...</a>",
